<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχρεως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ω</span> (masc. and fem.) <i><span class="en">
			<u>BGU</u>
			239.5
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>PFlor.</u>
			86.13
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχρεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			22.1132.22
		</span></i> (Decr. Amphict., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Sammelb.</u>
			4415.8
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό-χρεοι,
			-χρέους,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Plb.
			9.29.7
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			D.H.
			4.10
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρέος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>indebted, in debt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				242
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δῆμος ὑ. τῶν πλουσίων</span>
			<i>in</i> their <i>debt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινί</span>
			<i>dependent upon</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.17.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.51.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of property,
				<i>involved, encumbered,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				10.16
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>(sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρχ-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				49.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				50.61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>obliged, bound,</i> c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλίας καὶ
				χάριτος ὑ.</span>
			<i>bound by ties of</i> love and favour past, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				76
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.44
			</span></i>: also c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. χάριτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					21.19.10
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				9.29.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
